    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2066980/extras/d40f46195124b808754a977cff0dc4b3.poster.avif?t=1751547837\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2066980/extras/d40f46195124b808754a977cff0dc4b3.webp?t=1751547837\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2066980/extras/eb641c056aba7fd49179eb45b8d2ea52.poster.avif?t=1751547837\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2066980/extras/eb641c056aba7fd49179eb45b8d2ea52.webp?t=1751547837\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2066980/extras/04bd50eb04a104017c124ab5b2d96112.poster.avif?t=1751547837\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2066980/extras/04bd50eb04a104017c124ab5b2d96112.webm?t=1751547837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2066980/extras/14f4a04da03df014777b2c8d55e8d5c3.poster.avif?t=1751547837\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2066980/extras/14f4a04da03df014777b2c8d55e8d5c3.webm?t=1751547837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2066980/extras/5371506bb00f16fb78c7ad4824fb3116.avif?t=1751547837\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019re a 21-year old man who never had any relationships, but thanks to your archaeologist father you could enjoy your hobby - collecting ancient artifacts. Once, you touch a strange gem in your father\u2019s room, and a powerful demoness Arlecchino appears, threatening to take you to Hell with her!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2066980/extras/1d77a9f08606b94b598d38c84a802f81.avif?t=1751547837\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">However, thanks to Alicia, a powerful witch, you managed to strike a deal with the demoness - you have two weeks to find yourself a girlfriend and lose your virginity with her\u2026 Finding a girlfriend is hard when you\u2019ve only romanced them in video games. Flirt, give them gifts and improve your relations. Make them fall in love with you or burn in Hell!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2066980/extras/7edd7ff8bee4c4a192c44d1c8e1e743c.avif?t=1751547837\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019ll have a handful of mini-games to manage this task. First, make small talk, find out more about her and charm her with your erudition and insight in the style of a quiz. This won\u2019t have to be in-person - if you get her number, you\u2019ll have more chances talking with this beauty via messenger. Second, there\u2019s a diary, where you note all the girls\u2019 likes and dislikes. It\u2019s hard thinking straight when there\u2019s so many cute girls around\u2026</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Time is not on your side, so start winning girls\u2019 hearts right now!</strong><br><br></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2066980/extras/e68a1dba8bc535f4d2b05ade7f0d4b8e.avif?t=1751547837\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u270c\ufe0f Sexy and unique characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u270c\ufe0f 5 separate storylines</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u270c\ufe0f 5 non-repetitive endings </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u270c\ufe0f High quality animated H-scenes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u270c\ufe0f Dating simulator</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u270c\ufe0f A dialogue system with comics-style overlay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u270c\ufe0f Colorful locations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u270c\ufe0f Several different mini-games</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2066980/extras/1a6e61a5835cc1057855df6363576480.avif?t=1751547837\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2066980/extras/b4c23e20e6edd5b7f5a58ba8c51403ed.avif?t=1751547837\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2066980/extras/908e504016ab43dbd33565268f77c3e7.avif?t=1751547837\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2066980/extras/4ce03ca9830c0f1e216a331c63d98e18.avif?t=1751547837\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2066980/extras/80a2e6130dbc31bbfe0a368c9fcc38ef.avif?t=1751547837\" /></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2066980/extras/d40f46195124b808754a977cff0dc4b3.poster.avif?t=1751547837\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2066980/extras/d40f46195124b808754a977cff0dc4b3.webp?t=1751547837\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2066980/extras/eb641c056aba7fd49179eb45b8d2ea52.poster.avif?t=1751547837\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2066980/extras/eb641c056aba7fd49179eb45b8d2ea52.webp?t=1751547837\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2066980/extras/04bd50eb04a104017c124ab5b2d96112.poster.avif?t=1751547837\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2066980/extras/04bd50eb04a104017c124ab5b2d96112.webm?t=1751547837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2066980/extras/14f4a04da03df014777b2c8d55e8d5c3.poster.avif?t=1751547837\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2066980/extras/14f4a04da03df014777b2c8d55e8d5c3.webm?t=1751547837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2066980/extras/5371506bb00f16fb78c7ad4824fb3116.avif?t=1751547837\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019re a 21-year old man who never had any relationships, but thanks to your archaeologist father you could enjoy your hobby - collecting ancient artifacts. Once, you touch a strange gem in your father\u2019s room, and a powerful demoness Arlecchino appears, threatening to take you to Hell with her!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2066980/extras/1d77a9f08606b94b598d38c84a802f81.avif?t=1751547837\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">However, thanks to Alicia, a powerful witch, you managed to strike a deal with the demoness - you have two weeks to find yourself a girlfriend and lose your virginity with her\u2026 Finding a girlfriend is hard when you\u2019ve only romanced them in video games. Flirt, give them gifts and improve your relations. Make them fall in love with you or burn in Hell!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2066980/extras/7edd7ff8bee4c4a192c44d1c8e1e743c.avif?t=1751547837\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019ll have a handful of mini-games to manage this task. First, make small talk, find out more about her and charm her with your erudition and insight in the style of a quiz. This won\u2019t have to be in-person - if you get her number, you\u2019ll have more chances talking with this beauty via messenger. Second, there\u2019s a diary, where you note all the girls\u2019 likes and dislikes. It\u2019s hard thinking straight when there\u2019s so many cute girls around\u2026</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Time is not on your side, so start winning girls\u2019 hearts right now!</strong><br><br></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2066980/extras/e68a1dba8bc535f4d2b05ade7f0d4b8e.avif?t=1751547837\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u270c\ufe0f Sexy and unique characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u270c\ufe0f 5 separate storylines</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u270c\ufe0f 5 non-repetitive endings </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u270c\ufe0f High quality animated H-scenes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u270c\ufe0f Dating simulator</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u270c\ufe0f A dialogue system with comics-style overlay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u270c\ufe0f Colorful locations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u270c\ufe0f Several different mini-games</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2066980/extras/1a6e61a5835cc1057855df6363576480.avif?t=1751547837\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2066980/extras/b4c23e20e6edd5b7f5a58ba8c51403ed.avif?t=1751547837\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2066980/extras/908e504016ab43dbd33565268f77c3e7.avif?t=1751547837\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2066980/extras/4ce03ca9830c0f1e216a331c63d98e18.avif?t=1751547837\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2066980/extras/80a2e6130dbc31bbfe0a368c9fcc38ef.avif?t=1751547837\" /></div></p>",
